                  "enable_thinking": false
                },
                "repetition_penalty": 1.05
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "note": "The consumer ignores the profile's enable_thinking (I4) and merges the penalty into its role body. The orchestrator and the producer send the strict schema."
